<title>INDIA: SBI managing director becomes Bank of India chief.</title>
<headline>SBI managing director becomes Bank of India chief.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>State Bank of India (SBI) managing director M.G. Bhide has been appointed chairman of state-run Bank of India, a SBI official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Bhide takes over on May 1, 1997 from G. Kathuria who is retiring, the official said.</p>
<p>--Bombay newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
